  ('a4899f0a-48da-5375-95ab-f9b372fe77b9'::uuid, '19ba6d95-5dd4-5479-a06c-ccb7b0c52a55'::uuid, 'AGM Financial Services', 'AGM Financial Services · HUD multifamily (221(d)(4) / 223(f))', array['HUD_MULTIFAMILY']::text[], array['MULTIFAMILY']::text[], null::bigint, null::bigint, null::numeric, null::numeric, array['first']::text[], null::text, null::numeric, null::numeric, 'Directory MF-007: tier C, low confidence, lends in CA: Unconfirmed. States not set (empty means nationwide): confirm the footprint before approving. | Footprint: National (FHA mortgagee) | Programs (as published): HUD 223(f), HUD 221(d)(4), other FHA multifamily | Broker program: Not documented. AGM publishes an ''FHA Expert'' 223(f) criteria flier (2023) aimed at intermediaries; no stated broker fee policy found. | Fit: Nationwide FHA MAP lender serving market-rate and affordable apartments. Broker terms and California deals unconfirmed; low data. | Source: https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e3882db4b0f9a3409a88c46/t/64bfc524e1b6c42949f6d982/1690289494098/AGM_The_FHA_Expert-2023_7-25_flier.pdf'),
