  ('79496438-27e6-53c7-b1c0-fba9c8f52c82'::uuid, 'e821ffb4-5e90-53fd-839f-69a9bfdd7299'::uuid, 'Ullico / Union Labor Life Insurance Company', 'Ullico / Union Labor Life Insurance Company (J for Jobs) · Life insurance company', array['BANK_LIFE_CO', 'CONSTRUCTION']::text[], array['HOSPITALITY', 'MULTIFAMILY', 'COMMERCIAL', 'CONSTRUCTION']::text[], 500000000::bigint, 15000000000::bigint, null::numeric, 90.0::numeric, array['first']::text[], null::text, null::numeric, null::numeric, 'Directory IN-014: tier B, medium confidence, lends in CA: Yes. States not set (empty means nationwide): confirm the footprint before approving. | Footprint: National; over $950M invested in Southern California | Programs (as published): Construction loans, Construction-to-permanent, Participations (union-labor requirement) | Leverage: Up to 90% LTC for select properties | Term: Construction up to 36 months | Broker program: No published broker program found. J for Jobs lending-parameters page: $5M-$150M loans, construction terms up to 36 months, up to 90% LTC on select properties, and all construction must use union labor. California example: $57.5M loan to restart an all-union tower in Century City, Los Angeles. Program reports over 600 projects and more than $22B financed nationally. | Fit: One of the few life companies that makes high-leverage construction loans, and it is active in Southern California. Only works for union-built projects, and broker acceptance is unconfirmed. | Source: https://www.ullico.com/?p=3268'),
