  ('f9591590-7674-5111-a8fd-395fe6258403'::uuid, '2a5177e0-4e4a-55d9-baa2-1b2630b61c7c'::uuid, 'California Statewide Certified Development Corporation', 'California Statewide Certified Development Corporation (CSCDC) · SBA 504 CDC', array['SBA_7A', 'SBA_504']::text[], array['COMMERCIAL']::text[], null::bigint, null::bigint, null::numeric, null::numeric, array['first', 'second']::text[], null::text, null::numeric, null::numeric, 'Directory BK-031: tier B, medium confidence, lends in CA: Yes. States not set (empty means nationwide): confirm the footprint before approving. | Footprint: California statewide (Davis HQ; offices listed in Sacramento, Bay Area, Pasadena, Orange County/Yorba Linda) | Programs (as published): SBA 504, SBA 7(a) Community Advantage | Broker program: No broker program found. | Fit: A high-volume statewide CDC: 238 504 loans in FYE 9/30/2024 (GuideStar), with offices covering Sacramento to Orange County. A solid 504 outlet, but its broker policy is unknown. | Source: https://www.guidestar.org/profile/94-3064064'),
